1
00:00:00,427 --> 00:00:03,637
Stop her, Leonard! Stop her!

2
00:00:10,403 --> 00:00:13,683
(Penny:)-Where the hell's the coin?
-Wasn't the answer Sheldon's spot?

3
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:18,020
(Raj:)Oh, yes, Leonard. Yes, it was.

4
00:00:19,012 --> 00:00:22,182
(Bernadette:)-Then where's the coin?
-Yes, exactly.

5
00:00:22,349 --> 00:00:23,759
(Raj:)Where is the coin?

6
00:00:25,151 --> 00:00:27,461
(Raj:)Why don't you look in your pockets?

7
00:00:31,424 --> 00:00:34,034
(Raj:)I slipped them in there
earlier today.

8
00:00:36,096 --> 00:00:39,336
(Penny:)-I don't get it.
-Don't you see?

9
00:00:39,499 --> 00:00:43,609
(Raj:)When we're all having fun together,
we're already winners.

10
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:45,550
(Raj:)Oh, look. See?

11
00:00:45,705 --> 00:00:47,845
(Raj:)Even I'm a winner.

12
00:00:50,043 --> 00:00:51,313
(Leonard:)Are you kidding me?

13
00:00:52,712 --> 00:00:55,322
(Penny:)That is the stupidest thing
I've ever heard.

14
00:00:56,516 --> 00:01:01,026
(Bernadette:)You suck so hard.

